      },
      {
        "answer": "The Narrator/Host describes the squid curry as having a texture unlike anything he has tasted before, noting that it disintegrates in the mouth rather than being chewy.",
        "question": "What is unique about the squid curry texture according to the Narrator/Host?"
      },
      {
        "answer": "The fried fish costs RS 200.",
        "question": "What is the price of the fried fish the Narrator/Host orders in the second round?"
      },
      {
        "answer": "The Narrator/Host praises Sundari Akka for her dedication to her food stall and mentions that she has received many awards for her work.",
        "question": "Why does the Narrator/Host praise Sundari Akka?"
      },
      {
        "answer": "The Narrator/Host emphasizes the \"super fresh\" quality of the fish throughout the video, stating that the minimal seasoning and preparation are a testament to its natural flavors. He further supports this by showing the woman cleaning fresh fish in a basin, highlighting the use of high-quality ingredients.",
