  "youtube_description": "Vlog 08\n\nSundari Akka Kadai is a small shop at Marina beach. Sundari Akka who started this shop few years back and now popular among Chennai seafood lovers. They serve mackerel, kingfish, prawns, fish head, squid, etc.\n\nമറീന ബീച്ചിലെ ഒരു ചെറിയ കടയാണ് സുന്ദരി അക്ക കട. കുറച്ച് വർഷങ്ങൾക്ക് മുമ്പ് തുടങ്ങിയതാണ് ഈ ഷോപ്പ്. ഇപ്പോൾ ചെന്നൈ സീഫുഡ് പ്രേമികൾക്കിടയിൽ വളരെ ജനപ്രിയമാണ്. അയല, അയക്കൂറ , ചെമ്മീൻ, തല കറി , കണവ തുടങ്ങിയവ ഉച്ചക്ക് സ്‌പെഷൽ.\n\nSay Hi on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/aa_harem/?hl=en\n\nMusic: Funky Element by Benjamin Tissot on www.bensound.com\n\nAddress : Marina Beach Road, Near Marina Swimming Pool, Marina Beach, Triplicane, Chennai, Tamil Nadu 600005\nGoogle Location : Marina Beach Road, Near Marina Swimming Pool, Marina Beach, Triplicane, Chennai, Tamil Nadu 600005\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nAbout aaHarem\n\nGastronomist / Foodie / Malayali / Malabari\nആഹാരമാണ് നമ്മുടെ ആ  ഹരം\nSay Hi on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/aa_harem/?hl=en\n\nWe are two, a husband and wife who travels, shoots, edit, post and followup on YouTube and Instagram. We love to travel, explore & eat. We started this channel to share our experience. For aaHarem, it is not just about eating but it is about the people, culture, and feelings.  \n\nWe are at the learning curve, and we are creating this content with limited resources. If you see any fault on our video or you see some scope for improvement, please comment politely below. We are always happy to create great content.  \n\nAll reviews, feedback, and criticism on this channel are just our point of view. We do not mean it to offend anyone.  \n\nSupport us by subscribing and by hitting the notification button. https://www.instagram.com/aa_harem/?hl=en",
